---
import Layout from "../../layouts/Layout.astro";

const title = "Rojadirecta vs FootyBite: The Ultimate Guide to Free Soccer Streams 2026";
const description = "Discover the best free soccer streams. Compare Rojadirecta vs FootyBite, find safe alternatives, and learn how to watch live football online for free.";
const keywords = "Rojadirecta, FootyBite, free soccer streams, watch football online, soccer stream alternatives";
---

<Layout title={title} description={description} keywords={keywords}>
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 py-12">
    <article class="prose prose-invert max-w-none theme-text-primary">
      <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-6xl font-black mb-8 theme-text-primary">
        Rojadirecta vs FootyBite: The Ultimate Guide to Free Soccer Streams
      </h1>

      <div class="space-y-12 text-lg leading-relaxed theme-text-secondary">
        <section class="space-y-4">
          <h2 class="text-3xl font-black theme-text-primary">What is Rojadirecta?</h2>
          <p>
            Rojadirecta is one of the most famous and longest-running directories for live sports streaming links. It doesn't host content itself but provides a massive index of third-party streams for football, basketball, tennis, and more. Known for its simplicity and reliability, it has become a go-to name for sports fans worldwide looking for free match access.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="space-y-4">
          <h2 class="text-3xl font-black theme-text-primary">Rojadirecta vs FootyBite — Which Is Better?</h2>
          <p>
            While Rojadirecta offers a broad range of sports, FootyBite is specifically optimized for soccer fans. FootyBite often provides more stable HD links and a cleaner interface compared to the classic Rojadirecta layout. If you want variety, Rojadirecta is great; if you want the best football-specific experience, FootyBite usually takes the lead.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="space-y-4">
          <h2 class="text-3xl font-black theme-text-primary">How to Watch Free Soccer Streams Like Rojadirecta</h2>
          <p>
            Watching free streams is easy: simply browse our curated list of matches, select your game, and click the link. We recommend using a modern browser with an ad-blocker for the best experience. You don't need to sign up or pay anything to enjoy high-quality soccer action from major leagues like the Premier League, La Liga, and Champions League.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="space-y-4">
          <h2 class="text-3xl font-black theme-text-primary">Best Rojadirecta Alternatives in 2026</h2>
          <p>
            In 2026, the landscape of sports streaming continues to evolve. Apart from FootyBite, other reliable alternatives include Soccer Streams, BuffStreams, and CrackStreams. Our platform aggregates the best links from these sources, ensuring you always have a working mirror even if one site goes down.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="space-y-4">
          <h2 class="text-3xl font-black theme-text-primary">Is FootyBite Safe to Use?</h2>
          <p>
            FootyBite is generally considered safe as a directory, but like all free streaming sites, it contains third-party ads. Always ensure your system is updated and avoid downloading any "players" or "codecs" from external links. By using our verified links, you get a safer and more streamlined viewing experience without the hassle of intrusive pop-ups.
          </p>
        </section>
      </div>

      <div class="mt-12 pt-8 border-t border-[var(--border-color)]">
        <a href="/" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-[#f3a833] font-bold hover:underline">
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
            <path d="M19 12H5M12 19l-7-7 7-7"/>
          </svg>
          Back to Live Streams
        </a>
      </div>
    </article>
  </div>
</Layout>
